* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RLISPO - List Printouts
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* gw  93-07-01 s(999999) cleanup
* gw  94-05-13 s(999999) handle BS2 Job-id
* gw  94-05-18 s(999999) reset job-id (command = release)
* gw  94-07-04 s(999999) wake up monitor
* mrs 95-03-10 s(221046) avoid NAT1320
* mrs 95-03-23 s(221931) automatically created reports have from-line
*                        and to-line = 0 because of problems when
*                        printing reopend reports
* gw  96-09-09 s(999999) VTAM Restart
* gw  97-02-07 s(261503) new user type 'O' (operator) for printout queue
* jwo 97-09-23 s(165533) confirm window for delete has been lost
* gw  98-03-13 s(278970) save search values in independent variables
* sju 99-06-29 s(233509) restart printing line command
* fhi 00-01-27 s(191368) Module taken from NOM142 and stowed for NOM211
* sju 00-04-28 p(191368)  wake up print task
* wcd 00-04-01 CE 7267   New PFkey for additional printers in RPFK---L
* xsiszha 2000-08-15 (CE7461) Extend Report and Bundle Names
* sju 00-11-14 s(999999) SAT log server
* sju 01-04-23 p(204915) bundle print control exit
* xsetoba 02-05-23 (CE5903) BOT doesn't work
* sju 03-07-02 p(230407) printout retry
* xsetggr 2004-05-31 (ce5903)
* LP      2005-01-13 STOW WITH CHANGED LDA VPRRP-L - FIELD
*                    FIELD PO-LABEL (ADABAS SHORT NAME TP)IS MULTIPEL
* fhi     2005-04-14   NOM3107 Added Support for 7 byte jobnumbers
* xsetggr 2005-10-26 p(270950) ISN fields must be P10, not P8
* xsetggr 2007-08-30 NOM3201   Support P11 format run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-09-05 P(296832) add col 'Created' to printout list
* xsetggr 2007-11-05 NRT2768   show size of binary documents in bytes
* xsetggr 2007-11-26 NOM3203   prevent NAT1108 when change language
* xsetggr 2007-11-26 NRT2771   Start/Stop group of printers
* fhi     2008-01-28 P293939   Introduce new User type 'P' Printer
*                              associated.
* xsetggr 2008-02-24 add parm to RBINSZ-N
* xsetggr 2008-02-27 allowed browsed binary docs only from NGC client
* fhi     2008-03-02 P302629   added SAGSIS problem for line above.
* fhi     2008-02-28 P293939   User type 'P' Printer associated doesn't work
* xsetggr 2008-03-11 p(302778) change format of RBINSZ-N parms
* fhi     2008-04-28 P304674   Avoid printing of binary file types
* xsetggr 2008-05-05 p(304350) get size of binary docs from spool attr.
* xsetggr 2008-06-10 p(292935) do not display printing time when error
* fhi     2008-07-24 P307319   restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-CONTENTS
* fhi     2008-08-21 P305318   User type 'P' Printer associated doesn't work
* xsetggr 2008-08-21 p(303981) select unsucessfully printed(U) printouts
* fhi     2008-08-28 P307993   Printer status 'O' added
* xsetggr 2009-08-20 P319147   restrict browsing reports from printout
*                              queue
* xsetggr 2009-09-01 P314431   allow print only on DISKUNIX/NATUNIX
*                    printers for unix systems, on UNIXLP printers - for
*                    mainframe
* fhi     2009-11-12 P321483   Introduce new po status 'X'
* fhi     2009-12-11 P321483   Allow selection of status 'X'
* fhi     2010-03-05 P307403 Don't use text and binary reports mixed
* xsetggr 2010-03-08 P321493   corrrection for P319147 - operator can
*                    browse reports from own folders and linked folders,
*                    if linked folder is granted
* xsetggr 2010-03-10 P321493  delete trace print
* xsetggr 2010-03-16 P307403  restow - RPFKEX-C is changed back
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* xsetggr 2010-11-03 NOMALL-865 restow due to changes in EOMPHTYE
* xsetggr 2011-02-16 NOMALL-943 improve binary checking
* xsetggr 2011-03-03 NOMALL-953 correct setting folder grants
* fhi     2011-05-02 NOMALL-901 Log any online delete operation
* fhi     2011-09-14 NOMALL-901 Add printer name to logging
* xsetggr 2011-09-28 NOMALL-901 add report/bundle name + rnb to logging
* xsetggr 2011-11-02 NOMALL-970 implement report flag 'print once'
* raya    2012-01-31 NOMALL-1096 error-text a250 in NOMWK--P stow only
* xsetggr 2013-01-22 NOMALL-970 implementation cancelled
* SU1     2013-01-31 unused      Deactivate unused data areas
* SU2     2013-07-17 remove empty copy code CSTARTLS
* fhi     2013-09-04 NOMALL-1004 Give warning on mixed output formats
* fhi     2014-09-11 NOMALL-1454 Avoid too many blanks in status
* SU3     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* fhi     2015-05-18 NOMALL-1552 Show real size, not base64 size
* SU4     2015-06-01 NOMALL-1552 Show size 1 (instead 0)
* fhi     2015-06-29 NOMALL-1573 Give warning in case of binary bundles
* SU5     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* BLI     2016-02-23 NOMALL-1829 Check flags A R L
* SU6     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1518 NOM3.5 deactivate opt.Compiler
* fhi     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1748 Backout Report Formatting
* BLI     2017-08-18 NOMALL-1984 Check Display authorization
* SU7     2021-04-01 NOMALL-2444 remove bulk(not reachable code)
* SU8     2022-09-30 NOMALL-2549 (AHA ESM-I-12)/new cmd:MOve
